## User

Count how many times each word occurs in a text, as a map from each word to its count.

## Context

```haskell
words :: String -> [String]
M.insertWith :: Ord k => (a -> a -> a) -> k -> a -> M.Map k a -> M.Map k a
M.empty :: M.Map k a
```

## Type

type
```haskell
wordFreq :: String -> M.Map String Int
```

## Term

```haskell
wordFreq = words . M.insertWith (+) " " 1 . M.insertWith (+) " " 2 . M.insertWith (+) " " 3 . M.insertWith (+) " " 4
```

